OL,5,G0900 All Things Considered
OL,6,     FAzim Ahmed takes a tour of the
OL,7,     FLogos Hope, a Christian missionary
OL,8,     Fship where all of the crew, even
OL,9,     Fthe captain, are volunteers.
OL,10,G0933 Owen Money's Solid Gold Sunday
OL,11,     FA second dose of Owen Money for
OL,12,     Fthe weekend. It's non-stop music
OL,13,     Fall the way, with classics from
OL,14,     Fthe 60s, 70s and 80s and your
OL,15,     Fdedications!
OL,16,G1200 Robin Morgan
OL,17,     FRobin brings you the best in music
OL,18,     Fand guests for your Sunday
OL,19,     Fafternoon. Call 03700 100 110 Text
OL,20,     F81012 or message us via X
OL,21,     F@bbcradiowales.
