OL,6,     FMusic, entertainment and great
OL,7,     Fguests for your Sunday afternoon.
OL,8,G1700 Roy Noble
OL,9,     FRoy Noble is joined by King's
OL,10,     FCounsel Jonathan Caplan to discuss
OL,11,     Fhis fascinating book on UFOs, and
OL,12,     FShan Cothi tells us about Radio
OL,13,     F3's special Lighthouse Day
OL,14,     Fcelebration.
OL,15,G1900 Running Wales with Ben Sheppard
OL,16,     FBen Sheppard hears inspiring
OL,17,     Fstories from runners of all
OL,18,     Fabilities as they share their
OL,19,     Ffavourite routes around Wales. Ben
OL,20,     Fjoins Helen Ryvar in Llay,
OL,21,     FWrexham.
